is null + flag rather than a guess. (/seating/ itself is likewise a landing page with no grid, so it is a grouping row.)\n\nHIERARCHY: Sofas, Beds/Headboards/Mattresses and Outdoor Furniture have real children, so they are grouping rows and their children carry the qty. Coverage gaps between those parents and their children are flagged on the grouping rows.\n\nEXCLUDED and why: Leather Sofas (4) - verified by product-ID set comparison to be a strict subset of 2 & 3 Seater Sofas, i.e. a material filter view, barred by the never-extract list. Quick Delivery Sofas (26) and Quick Delivery Armchairs (32) - delivery/availability filter views, not product types. Made to Order Collections / 'Made to Order Furniture' (/seating/custom-made-furniture/, 38) - a made-to-order upholstery range whose 30+ children are named collections (Annette, Battersea, Stockholm...), i.e. collections, and whose products duplicate Sofas and Armchairs. Mattresses (4) - bedding, not furniture, and the site does split them out from Beds. Garden Furniture Covers (1, an outdoor storage bag) and Garden Furniture Care - furniture care/covers. Pergolas & Awnings (0) - garden structures, not furniture. Wine Racks & Kitchen Storage (5 - wine racks and a wire storage rack, one wall-mounted) and Magazine Racks (4 - magazine racks and holders) - standalone storage goods. Bags & Baskets, Laundry Baskets - storage goods. Shelves (16) and Hooks & Hook Racks (29) - the prior pass read every product and found them all to be decorative wall shelves / wall hooks, so they stay with Wall Decor. All of Lighting, Mirrors, Soft Furnishings, Accessories, Indoor Planting, Gifts, Christmas, Halloween, Pet, Door Furniture, Hardware, Doormats and Fireside - not furniture. Sale, New, Bestsellers, Inspiration/Trends/Collections/Stylists Edit/Live Shopping, the 20-75% off nodes and Outdoor > In Stock - marketing views. Shop By Room (Bathroom, Dining, Hallway, Home Office, Kitchen, Lounge, Utility) - mixed all-product-type roll-ups with no furniture-specific children; checked and dropped. Bedroom, Storage, Tables and Garden department roll-ups themselves are grouping rows only.\n\nZERO-COUNT ROWS: Modular Sofas, Sofa Beds, Bistro Sets and Outdoor Hanging Chairs are live nav categories that currently list zero products (confirmed by Magento's empty-category message). Recorded as qty 0 with a flag rather than dropped, since 0 is the site's own exact number.",
